// title: Microsoft Entra Identity Attack Threat Detection
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Sentinel
// tables: AzureActivity
// purpose: Microsoft Entra Identity Attack Threat Detection
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/Microsoft%20Entra%20Identity%20Attack%20Threat%20Detection.kql
// kind: repo
